This goal of this project is to identify the marketing strategies that should be taken to get more term deposit sales to a customer base.
After data analysis and cleanup, Ensemble models of baggin and boosting as well as regression models are fit to the dataset to predict customers that are expected to take a loan.
From this, insights are drawn as to the profile of customer that took a loan and the sales tactics that were used to facilitate that conversion.
Testing methods and confusion matrices are used to then evaluate how the model can be improved within the context of the sales teams goals.
